# A fine STL past 64 MB (user's exhaust export 2026-11-20: 270 MB, 5.4 M triangles) used to be refused as
# "Could not read": the general file reader's 64 MB limit. STLs now open up to 2 GB.
budget p95 400 max 30000
open $SB/ws/cavity
shell python3 "$QC_TESTS/tools/gen_big_stl.py" ../big.stl 900
click nav:mesh
wait-until page Mesh
click text:STL mesher
wait 5
click stl-path
enter $SB/ws/big.stl
wait 30
assert not text Could not read
assert text 3236400 triangles
assert text Closed (watertight)
assert file mesher/mesher.ini
screenshot $OUT/stl_big.png
